#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
IYI_RELEASE_URL
  Base URL for a release's files, e.g. https://mirror.example/iyi/v0.21.0.
  It must serve the platform archive and SHA256SUMS. Defaults to the GitHub
  release. Only https:// and file:// URLs are accepted.

The plugin needs no other configuration: versions are installed under asdf's
or mise's data directory and iyi finds its libraries beside the executable.

A C toolchain is required to build iyi programs, but not to install the
compiler: cc (gcc or clang) on Linux and macOS, the MSVC toolset and Windows
SDK on Windows. iyi itself needs glibc 2.31+ on Linux and macOS 14.4+.
EOF
